  (text "J1: female 2 x 8 socket on the front; the module's own pins plug into it. Pinout measured on the module: 1 GND, 2 VCC, 4 CLK, 5 DIN, 14 D/C, 15 RES, 16 CS; the parallel-bus pins stay open, as on the working bench setup." (at 80 40 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "04e007ee-f810-5426-9561-56b3c4438014"))
