  (text "Native USB: hold BOOT, tap RESET, then upload over USB-C (or use the ROM loader on the USB CDC port)." (at 100 195 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2d768d63-a1fa-50ea-af72-2373a6f31ffa"))
  (text "POWER: J3 +5 V (through the cable port PTC) or USB VBUS, ORed by two Schottkys into +5V. AP7361C-33E (1 A, 0.36 V dropout, SOT-223 for the heat) makes +3V3 (ESP32, OLED, CAN VIO, LEDs). The CAN transceiver takes its 5 V straight from the cable, ahead of the diode." (at 15 130 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2729cd8e-1500-5f9e-9cce-58f42b8311b5"))
