  (text "CAN (node 0x13): MCP2562, VDD 5 V straight from the cable (CAB_5V, ahead of the OR diode, so it stays above its 4.5 V minimum), VIO 3.3 V, STBY low. No 120 R: the console never terminates the bus. J3 pin order is the DigiDash cable-port one." (at 15 280 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b9f2dd2a-0d6e-59d4-8116-596d42d532c9"))
