  (text "YELLOW LEDS (to match the yellow OLED): four 0603 LEDs, one on each side of each key, from the same +3V3 rail as the OLED, each with its own 100 R (about 13 mA each, 52 mA total), switched on the low side by Q1. GPIO38 runs PWM (LEDC) to dim them, the way the firmware sets the OLED contrast: one brightness value drives all four." (at 220 130 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "70cb1f24-4837-5b35-959c-8301caeaff27"))
